# expect.stdout: 7\n
# expect.exit: 0
project BoolUserOpInBranchIf
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1
entry console main
error MainError
errorCase MainError Placeholder Int32

operation isOdd
input operation isOdd n Int64
output operation isOdd Result Bool Void
memory isOdd heap no
async isOdd no
purpose operation isOdd "Return true when n is odd. Exercises a Bool-returning user op that is binarized via `bind X Bool callRes` then used in `branchIf X` — the i64 → i1 trunc path."
invariant operation isOdd "Uses math.moduloInt64 with 2 to test parity."
label startIsOdd
storage module immutable twoModulus Int64 2
storage module immutable zeroRemainder Int64 0
call modCall math.moduloInt64
argument modCall left Int64 n
argument modCall right Int64 twoModulus
run modCall
bind value remainder Int64 modCall
call eqCall math.equalInt64
argument eqCall left Int64 remainder
argument eqCall right Int64 zeroRemainder
run eqCall
bind value isZero Bool eqCall
branch if condition isZero target reportEvenCase
storage module immutable trueValue Int64 1
memory isOdd mutable oddResult Bool trueValue
return ok oddResult
label reportEvenCase
storage module immutable falseValue Int64 0
memory isOdd mutable evenResult Bool falseValue
return ok evenResult

operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
async main no
purpose operation main "Count odd numbers in 1..6 via isOdd; expect 3, then also exercise an even/odd branch directly. Final printed value is total odd count + first-odd-seen."
invariant operation main "isOdd(1) and isOdd(2) yield Bool values used by branchIf."
label startMain
storage module immutable oneTarget Int64 1
storage module immutable twoTarget Int64 2
call oneOddCall isOdd
argument oneOddCall n Int64 oneTarget
run oneOddCall
bind ok oneIsOdd Bool oneOddCall
call twoOddCall isOdd
argument twoOddCall n Int64 twoTarget
run twoOddCall
bind ok twoIsOdd Bool twoOddCall
memory main mutable totalScore Int64 0
storage module immutable fiveBoost Int64 5
storage module immutable twoBoost Int64 2
branch if condition oneIsOdd target boostFromOne
branch else target maybeBoostTwo
label boostFromOne
set memory totalScore fiveBoost
jump target maybeBoostTwo
label maybeBoostTwo
branch if condition twoIsOdd target boostFromTwo
branch else target printResult
label boostFromTwo
call wrongBoostCall math.addInt64
argument wrongBoostCall left Int64 totalScore
argument wrongBoostCall right Int64 twoBoost
run wrongBoostCall
bind value wrongScore Int64 wrongBoostCall
set memory totalScore wrongScore
jump target printResult
label printResult
call sumCall math.addInt64
argument sumCall left Int64 totalScore
argument sumCall right Int64 twoBoost
run sumCall
bind value finalScore Int64 sumCall
memory main mutable finalStorage Int64 0
set memory finalStorage finalScore
call writeCall console.writeIntegerLine
argument writeCall console Console console
argument writeCall value Int64 finalStorage
run writeCall
ignore void source writeCall
storage module immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
return ok successfulExitCode
